OL,3,GNEWSANew #1m grant to help groups
OL,4,Aprotect green spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #1m fund has been set up to help
OL,7,Flocal communities protect threatened
OL,8,Fgreen spaces.
OL,10,FThe Summerfield Charitable Trust said
OL,11,Fthe money would help groups buy and
OL,12,Fsafeguard local woodlands and wildlife
OL,13,Fsites when they come up for sale.
OL,15,FIt is part of a new initiative from the
OL,16,FGloucestershire Nature and Climate Fund
OL,17,Fand the Gloucestershire Local Nature
OL,18,FPartnership.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
