OL,3,GNEWSANew #1m grant to help groups
OL,4,Aprotect green spaces
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We need an initiative like this now
OL,7,Fmore than ever," said Diane Hill, chair
OL,8,Fof the Gloucestershire Nature and
OL,9,FClimate Fund. "Once an important green
OL,10,Fspace is lost, it can be lost for
OL,11,Fgood."
